  "hints": ["Walk the train with one finger and compare each car with the car right behind it.", "If the next car repeats the number, SET NEXT of the current car to the car after it, and stay where you are: the new neighbour may repeat the number too.", "Only move on when the next car has a different number, or there is no next car."],
